#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:5 99e242e6d31d4c51850a0e1155353173
msgid "AutoTrim"
msgstr "AutoTrim"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:7 7f41f4e6338b4b09b21c9b9b9efc72ea
msgid ""
"Wind of course has a strong effect on your copter and will push it around. "
"However you may also find that while flying in stabilize mode, even in a "
"windless environment your copter tends to always drift away in the same "
"direction. This can largely be corrected using the \"Save Trim\" or "
"\"Automatic Trim\" functions."
msgstr ""
"风当然对飞行器有很大影响，会将其推来推去。但您可能还会发现，即使在无风环境中以Stabilize模式飞行，飞行器也总是朝同一方向漂移。这主要可以通过\"保存微调\"或\"自动微调\"功能来纠正。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:11 8f50187485a84dd3a2dbdbb67b5abc8f
msgid ""
"For most users this procedure is not necessary because the "
":ref:`accelerometer calibration <common-accelerometer-calibration>` does a "
"good job of setting the trim values."
msgstr ""
"对于大多数用户来说，此过程并不必要，因为 :ref:`加速度计校准 <common-accelerometer-calibration>` "
"已能很好地设置微调值。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:14 948730d9c23d4f46949b7a1ee839f36c
msgid "Save Trim"
msgstr "保存微调"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:16 f09e18485cdb42ddbc69108dd1ac0af6
msgid ""
"Save trim is the simpler method and involves essentially transferring your "
"radio transmitter's trims to the autopilot (`video demo here "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ayA0uYOqKX4>`__)."
msgstr ""
"保存微调是较简单的方法，本质上是将遥控器的微调值传输到飞控（`视频演示在此 "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ayA0uYOqKX4>`__）。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:18 4fa2a0f5fdca488787a7c88da7a27eb4
msgid ""
"Check that your CH7 switch goes above 1800 on the MissionPlanner's Hardware "
"> Mandatory Hardware > Radio Calibration screen"
msgstr ""
"在MissionPlanner的Hardware > Mandatory Hardware > Radio "
"Calibration界面检查CH7开关是否超过1800。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:23 f8c4283bafae4e9bbc839276db8b9424
msgid ""
"Set the CH7 Option to Save Trim on the Software > Copter Pids screen and "
"press the \"Write Params\" button"
msgstr "在Software > Copter Pids界面将CH7选项设置为Save Trim，并按\"Write Params\"按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:28 f79bb2cefd814b59a893fcb8d9a32c1b
msgid ""
"With your CH7 switch in the off position, fly your copter in Stabilize mode "
"and use your transmitters's roll and pitch trim to get it flying level"
msgstr "将CH7开关置于关闭位置，在Stabilize模式下飞行，使用遥控器的横滚和俯仰微调使其水平飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:30 b0e0baf49baa416c84241eef60384dab
msgid "Land and put your throttle to zero"
msgstr "降落并将油门降至零。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:32 dd823766878243ecbe5cd3e847e018a9
msgid ""
"Release the roll and pitch sticks and switch the CH7 switch high for at "
"least 1 second.  The words \"Trim saved\" should appear in the MP's Flight "
"Data screen's Messages tab"
msgstr "松开横滚和俯仰摇杆，将CH7开关拨高至少1秒。MP飞行数据界面的消息标签应出现\"Trim saved\"字样。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:34 5d3e3a17fbe94ff3ae15a8c5990b25b4
msgid ""
"Reset your transmitters roll and pitch trims back to the center and fly "
"again and it should fly level now. If it does not repeat steps 3, 4 & 5"
msgstr "将遥控器的横滚和俯仰微调重置回中心，再次飞行，现在应该能水平飞行了。如果不行，重复步骤3、4、5。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:37 475c2910030041f8af66c8c694305871
msgid "Auto Trim"
msgstr "自动微调"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:39 58bedd3b047b4ddd809a268cd8b53d47
msgid ""
"With auto trim the roll and pitch trim are captured as you fly in a stable "
"hover."
msgstr "使用自动微调时，横滚和俯仰微调在稳定悬停飞行中自动捕获。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:41 9356a0f398634111a899f4e097fd120c
msgid ""
"Find a wind free environment with sufficient space to fly your copter "
"without crashing into something"
msgstr "找一个无风的环境，有足够空间飞行飞行器而不撞到任何东西。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:43 ae687f07600b454d8007f80c16d1cdd4
msgid "Put the vehicle in Stabilize mode"
msgstr "将飞行器置于Stabilize模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:45 6a467ffa55e845cea454382ff5b144fb
msgid ""
"Hold throttle down and rudder right for 15seconds or until you see the small"
" red, blue and yellow leds flash in a cyclic pattern"
msgstr "将油门下压、方向舵向右保持15秒，或直到看到红、蓝、黄小LED以循环方式闪烁。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:47 8bc82b1ac810405ba0a4b33d03dacc76
msgid "Fly your copter for about 25 seconds in a stable hover"
msgstr "在稳定悬停状态下飞行约25秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:49 7e8e05abc2a44ec990cc5ef6019c0149
msgid ""
"Land and put your throttle to zero and wait for a few seconds (the trims "
"parameters are being saved)"
msgstr "降落并将油门降至零，等待几秒钟（微调参数正在保存）。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:51 9549c4c5887c4fe081630a3d22bf4725
msgid ""
"Take off again in stabilize mode and check if your copter is flying level "
"now. If not repeat steps 2, 3 and 4"
msgstr "再次在Stabilize模式下起飞，检查飞行器现在是否水平飞行。如果不行，重复步骤2、3、4。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:55 1c96fd9f7e8c4e358ac2314675d8dbcb
msgid ""
"You can also test these procedures above are operational on the ground with "
"your battery disconnected. Connect your autopilot to the mission planner and"
" observing the Flight Data screen as you simulate completing the steps "
"above."
msgstr ""
"您也可以在断开电池的情况下在地面测试上述程序是否正常工作。将飞控连接到Mission Planner，在模拟完成上述步骤时观察飞行数据界面。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:62 7fc1921cdd6c4bce85de3b8ab75441ad
msgid ""
"You can manually set the trim by modifying the :ref:`AHRS_TRIM_X "
"<AHRS_TRIM_X>` and :ref:`AHRS_TRIM_Y <AHRS_TRIM_Y>`. Roll trim is "
":ref:`AHRS_TRIM_X <AHRS_TRIM_X>`, Pitch trim is :ref:`AHRS_TRIM_Y "
"<AHRS_TRIM_Y>`. Both values are in radians with left roll and forward pitch "
"being negative numbers."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过修改 :ref:`AHRS_TRIM_X <AHRS_TRIM_X>` 和 :ref:`AHRS_TRIM_Y <AHRS_TRIM_Y>` "
"手动设置微调。横滚微调为 :ref:`AHRS_TRIM_X <AHRS_TRIM_X>`，俯仰微调为 :ref:`AHRS_TRIM_Y "
"<AHRS_TRIM_Y>`。两个值均以弧度表示，向左横滚和向前俯仰为负数。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:66 f2f2ed6197a24255baa607bf5ad5e268
msgid ""
"It is nearly impossible to get rid of all drift so that your copter remains "
"completely motionless without any input."
msgstr "几乎不可能消除所有漂移，使飞行器在没有任何输入的情况下完全静止。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:69 379343ebf7cd456b8bfc9a2bba982f5f
msgid "Video demonstrations of Save Trim and Auto Trim"
msgstr "保存微调和自动微调的视频演示"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:78 3d4423e4478345e0b7d86ba80c484e13
msgid "Desktop method"
msgstr "桌面方法"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:80 6b3e1a3735614bc99a73f4a126d59df3
msgid ""
"The trim can also be updated by setting the vehicle level, connecting to the"
" Mission Planner (or perhaps other ground stations) and selecting Initial "
"Setup, Mandatory Hardware, Accel Calibration and pushing the lower "
"\"Calibrate Level\" button."
msgstr ""
"也可以通过将飞行器放平、连接Mission Planner（或其他地面站）并选择Initial Setup、Mandatory "
"Hardware、Accel Calibration，然后按下方的\"Calibrate Level\"按钮来更新微调。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:88 826a362a753e4aa381e5c05e10b192a6
msgid ""
"Please note though that making the HUD level while the vehicle is on the "
"ground does not necessarily mean it won't drift horizontally while flying "
"because of other small frame issues including the flight controller not "
"being perfectly level on the frame and slightly tilted motors."
msgstr "请注意，在地面使飞控HUD水平并不一定意味着飞行时不会水平漂移，因为还有其他小的机架问题，包括飞控未完全水平安装在机架上以及电机略有倾斜。"
